couch,</i> and <i>a throne:</i>] pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَانِدُ</span>. (KL. [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْنَدٌ</span>, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَدٌ</span>.])

